# Gauge-weight lower-bound tables (Init only)

`gaugeTab k` lists, for radial region `k`, lower bounds of `V7.gaugeWeight r` on the `2^D`
equal grid cells of `[R_k, R_{k+1}]` (`gaugeDepth k = D`). Generated by `KBNGaugeGen` from
`KBN.certValU` and rounded down; `KBNGaugeTabSound` checks every entry by `native_decide`
and proves `gaugeLoDy_sound`. `gaugeLoDy` looks up a dyadic box `[num/2^lev, (num+1)/2^lev]`
of the unit coordinate. Out-of-range reads return 0, also a valid bound (`gaugeWeight ≥ 0`).
-/

